    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδῐον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place of sojourn in the open
			air</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδια πέτρης</span>, of a
			grotto, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.371
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδιον εὐφροσύνης</span>
			<i>seat</i> of joyousness, epith. of a winecask, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.63
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. Ἁμαδρυάδων</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.668
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Marian.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δὲ . . ἔνδιον ᾖ Πιτάνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).730.14
				</span></i>
			 (Sparta, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>).--Poet. word.</div>
